      "lessonId": "lesson-cs-arch-pipeline-foundations-01",
      "subtopicId": "cs-arch-pipeline-hazards-forwarding",
      "front": "Forwarding 為何能減少 stall？",
      "back": "它把已產生的 result 從 pipeline register 直接送到後續 EX input，省去等待 register-file write-back。",
      "explanation": "Forwarding 不會讓尚未完成的 load data 提早出現。",
